{"id":"n80757-1-13","stage":5,"title":"침략 · 侵略","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80757-1-13-1","ko":"해안을 따라 초소가 많이 있네.","zh":"沿着海岸线有好多哨所呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해안을","meaning":"海岸，海边","explanation":"해안：海岸，海边；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"해안","audio":"/audio/4278861b2d06d0a87aba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85797","senseId":"1","lemma":"해안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해안을","audio":"/audio/0a051cebb3923765ebbb.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"沿着","explanation":"따르다：沿着；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"6","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"초소가","meaning":"哨所，岗哨","explanation":"초소：哨所，岗哨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초소","audio":"/audio/847106931cb8c0eae4ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79604","senseId":"1","lemma":"초소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초소가","audio":"/audio/74474ac84e4481b0d59b.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네","audio":"/audio/a43e47a1fb823079c63a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4278861b2d06d0a8","term":"해안","zh":"海岸，海边","audio":"/audio/4278861b2d06d0a87aba.mp3","entryId":"85797","definition":"大海和陆地相接的地方。","pronunciation":["해ː안"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"沿着","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"按照一定的线路或方向等移动。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"847106931cb8c0ea","term":"초소","zh":"哨所，岗哨","audio":"/audio/847106931cb8c0eae4ee.mp3","entryId":"79604","definition":"由士兵负责警戒和监察的场所，如部队警戒线、各进进出口等。","pronunciation":["초소"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e67ae433917750926681.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80757-1-13-2","ko":"응, 외세의 침략에 대비해서 옛날부터 해안 지역에는 병사들이 많이 배치됐었어.","zh":"嗯，为了防范外敌入侵，从很久以前起海岸地区就部署了大量士兵。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"외세의","meaning":"外国势力，外部势力","explanation":"외세：外国势力，外部势力；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"외세","audio":"/audio/df3e04c4ad6f7065de2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69113","senseId":"1","lemma":"외세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외세의","audio":"/audio/1635b2a803ec7557a931.mp3"}},{"text":"침략에","meaning":"侵略，侵吞","explanation":"침략：侵略，侵吞；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"침략","audio":"/audio/a9da2cf43efac4bcae15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80757","senseId":"1","lemma":"침략","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"침략에","audio":"/audio/67f2781f921afe13df10.mp3"}},{"text":"대비해서","meaning":"预备，应对，防备","explanation":"대비하다：预备，应对，防备；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"대비하다","audio":"/audio/c2579a13847219524316.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14339","senseId":"1","lemma":"대비